   "seed": 695312253,
   "text": "Read top to bottom: A Dashboard \u00b7 B Counter (one ticket, Rent/Sell per line, printed slip) \u00b7 C Orders \u00b7 D Sale returns \u00b7 E Customers \u00b7 F Reports.\nWalk-in or phone search \u00b7 register in a drawer \u00b7 price input defaults to catalogue, staff may type higher \u00b7 slip ends with barcode + QR of the order number.\nReturn = scan slip \u2192 collect/refund \u2192 stock back. Deposits are a liability. Every create/edit is a drawer.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Read top to bottom: A Dashboard \u00b7 B Counter (one ticket, Rent/Sell per line, printed slip) \u00b7 C Orders \u00b7 D Sale returns \u00b7 E Customers \u00b7 F Reports.\nWalk-in or phone search \u00b7 register in a drawer \u00b7 price input defaults to catalogue, staff may type higher \u00b7 slip ends with barcode + QR of the order number.\nReturn = scan slip \u2192 collect/refund \u2192 stock back. Deposits are a liability. Every create/edit is a drawer.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
